     In this scenario, iippsseecc..ccoonnff is used to set up flows and SAs automati‐
     cally using isakmpd(8) with the ISAKMP/Oakley a.k.a. IKEv1 protocol.  To
     configure automatic keying using the IKEv2 protocol, see iked.conf(5) in‐
     stead.  Some examples of setting up automatic keying:

        # Set up a VPN:
        # First between the gateway machines 192.168.3.1 and 192.168.3.2
        # Second between the networks 10.1.1.0/24 and 10.1.2.0/24
        ike esp from 192.168.3.1 to 192.168.3.2
        ike esp from 10.1.1.0/24 to 10.1.2.0/24 peer 192.168.3.2

