           _d_y_n_a_m_i_c.  When _p_a_s_s_i_v_e is specified, isakmpd(8) will not immedi‐
           ately start negotiation of this tunnel, but wait for an incoming
           request from the remote peer.  When _a_c_t_i_v_e or _d_y_n_a_m_i_c is specified,
           negotiation will be started at once.  The _d_y_n_a_m_i_c mode will addi‐
